{
  "name": "content--deliverable-to-wordpress--v1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Deliverable → WordPress\n\n**前置条件**\n- Directus 已应用 4 集合快照，交付物状态为 `approved`\n- `tenants.wp_base_url` 可访问，`environment` 已区分生产/预发\n- WordPress 已开启 REST 与 Application Password\n\n**导入后必须修改**\n1. `Config`：`directusUrl`、`batchLimit`\n2. `Push content` / `Media lookup` / `Upload media` / `Download image`：选择 WordPress Application Password 凭据\n3. `Push product` / `Update product`：选择 WooCommerce Consumer Key/Secret 凭据\n4. 先“手动测试”，确认后启用定时触发\n\n**行为**\n- 只处理 `status=approved` 且 `target_post_type` 非空的交付物\n- 先置为 `pushing`，成功后写回 `wp_post_id`/`wp_url`/`pushed_at` 并置 `pushed`\n- 失败置 `failed` 并写 `last_error`，同时写 `runs`\n- `draft_only` 策略下永远只写草稿\n\n**已知边界**\n- 分类/标签只发送数字 ID；名称会记入 `runs.payload_summary.skipped_terms`\n- 一个工作流实例对应一套 WordPress 凭据；多客户站点需复制流程或改子流程\n- Markdown 转换仅覆盖标题、段落、列表、粗斜体、链接",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0001-4e5f-8a9b-0c1d2e3f4a01",
      "name": "说明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0002-4e5f-8a9b-0c1d2e3f4a02",
